  "title": "Under Armour Announces John Varvatos as Chief Design Officer",
  "summary": "Today, Under Armour is proud to announce that fashion industry veteran John Varvatos will join the company as Chief Design Officer, effective September 11, 2023. Varvatos started consulting for UA earlier this year and brings his deep expertise in style and form to the company. Varvatos will lead the creative design direction of the company and oversee the design studios in New York, Baltimore and Portland, Oregon.",
